For information on the helicity channels and indices, refer to:
Helicty Scaler Channel Map: hallc_replay/MAPS/SCALERS/scaler_hel.map
BCM number index map: hallc_replay/PARAM/GEN/gscalers.param

The relevant helicity information from this file may be copied to
the user's template file, or it may be loaded as a separate template
file in the replay script.

For the DAQ in coin. mode, it is sufficient to look at the SHMS helicity
scalers as the 32-channel inputs of the module are daisy-chained via two
16-channel ribbon cables, and each module receives an identical copy of the
other for redundancy. Furthermore, the relevant scaler signals in coin. mode
are pTRIG1-6 and the BCMs, but NOT hTRIG1-6.

